1
00:00:00,784 --> 00:00:02,313
This video is for doctors.

2
00:00:02,313 --> 00:00:08,017
You will learn how to review and approve your nurse's requests, read your report, and follow your

3
00:00:08,017 --> 00:00:09,134
patients' lab work.

4
00:00:09,585 --> 00:00:14,005
Open the system link, write your name and password, and tap Sign in.

5
00:00:15,382 --> 00:00:19,923
Your page opens on Reviews. The cards at the top count your requests:

6
00:00:19,923 --> 00:00:27,162
waiting for your review, approved, sent to the branch, and received. Tap any card to show only those requests.

7
00:00:27,612 --> 00:00:33,952
Tap a request to open it. You see each item, the quantity the nurse asked for, and the price.

8
00:00:34,402 --> 00:00:40,572
If a quantity is too much or too little, change it. You can also write a note on any item.

9
00:00:41,022 --> 00:00:46,782
Then tap Approve. The request goes to procurement right away, and the nurse can follow it.

10
00:00:47,232 --> 00:00:50,812
If something is wrong, write the reason and tap Reject.

11
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:54,912
The request goes back to the nurse to fix it and send it again.

12
00:00:57,558 --> 00:01:03,008
Tap Requests report to see what you ordered. Choose one month, or cumulative until a date.

13
00:01:03,459 --> 00:01:11,139
The report shows each request with its items, quantities, prices and the total. You can print it or save it as PDF.

14
00:01:11,590 --> 00:01:17,400
On the Lab page, you follow your patients' lab work: where each case is now, and when it is due.

15
00:01:18,148 --> 00:01:22,405
A note for dermatology doctors: your page shows no prices at all.

16
00:01:22,405 --> 00:01:27,578
You see only the items and quantities, and you review and approve the same way.

17
00:01:31,458 --> 00:01:37,678
To change your password, tap the lock icon at the bottom, then write the old and the new password.

18
00:01:38,129 --> 00:01:44,419
That's it. Please review your requests quickly, so your clinic gets its supplies on time. Thank you!
